<title>UK: RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITISH PREMIERSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>RUGBY LEAGUE-BRITISH PREMIERSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a British rugby league</p>
<p>premiership semifinal on Sunday:</p>
<p> St Helens     25	  London	    14</p>
<p> St Helens play Wigan in the final.</p>
<p>Wigan beat Bradford Bulls 32-26 on Saturday to go through to</p>
<p>the final on September 8.</p>
</text>
